<title>USA: Dow skids 100 points, following bond market.</title>
<headline>Dow skids 100 points, following bond market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue chip stocks plummeted more than 100 points on Friday, following the bond market lower.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was down 100.80 at 8,087.20 at 9:43 a.m. EDT.</p>
